Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.62,VO,,0,0,0,,SUNDAY. DAY SEVEN. FOR
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.62,0:00:03.00,VO,,0,0,0,,THE FIRST TIME ALL WEEK, I
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.00,0:00:03.80,VO,,0,0,0,,WALKED DOWN THE STAIRS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.80,0:00:05.11,VO,,0,0,0,,LIKE A NORMAL PERSON.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.31,0:00:07.96,DAD,,0,0,0,,MORNING, MAX! MORNING, LILY! MORNING...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.17,DAD,,0,0,0,,PUMPKIN GIRL?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.39,0:00:12.82,MAX,,0,0,0,,DAD, THIS IS SKYE. SHE'S THE GHOST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.24,DAD,,0,0,0,,THE PANCAKE THIEF!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.36,SKYE,,0,0,0,,SORRY ABOUT THE PANCAKES. AND THE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.36,0:00:18.45,SKYE,,0,0,0,,SHEET. AND THE HAM. AND THE FRIDGE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.67,0:00:19.80,LILY,,0,0,0,,I KNEW FIRST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.01,0:00:20.88,DAD,,0,0,0,,YOU KNEW?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.08,0:00:22.47,LILY,,0,0,0,,SHE WAS MY HORSE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.55,0:00:23.25,DAD,,0,0,0,,DOES YOUR MOTHER KNOW
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.25,0:00:24.60,DAD,,0,0,0,,WHERE YOU'VE BEEN ALL WEEK?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.72,0:00:26.69,SKYE,,0,0,0,,SHE THINKS I'M AT A SLEEPOVER.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.73,0:00:27.60,DAD,,0,0,0,,FOR A WEEK?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.79,SKYE,,0,0,0,,IT'S A REALLY LONG SLEEPOVER.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.85,0:00:31.43,DAD,,0,0,0,,PHONE. NOW. THEN PANCAKES.
